{
  "id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme/picrita",
  "type": "Concept",
  "prefLabel": {
    "en": "picrite",
    "es": "picrita"
  },
  "definition": {
    "en": "Black ultrabasic rock of doleritic or microlithic texture, with a SiO2 content of 30-52%, MgO greater than 12% and Na2O+K2O less than 3%. It is rich in ferromagnesian minerals, with dominant olivine, augite and, accessorily, amphibole, biotite and plagioclase",
    "es": "Roca ultrabásica negra de textura dolerítica o microlítica, con un contenido en sio2 del 30-52%, mgo mayor del 12% y na2o+k2o menor del 3%. es rica en minerales ferromagnesianos, con olivino dominante, augita y, accesoriamente, anfíbol, biotita y plagioclasa"
  },
